---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'November 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Legal Disclaimer — YouTube Video Downloader"
  description="Important legal disclaimer regarding trademark attribution, non-affiliation with YouTube or Google LLC, and user copyright responsibility."
  canonicalUrl="https://youtubevideodownloader.app/disclaimer"
>
  <Navbar />

  <main class="flex-1 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 w-full">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-10 text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] text-[#171717] mb-3 shadow-xs">
        <span class="mono-eyebrow text-[11px] text-[#4d4d4d]">Legal Information</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="heading-lg text-[#171717] mb-2">
        Legal Disclaimer
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-[#8f8f8f]">
        Last updated: {lastUpdated} • Non-affiliation & intellectual property notice
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content Sections -->
    <div class="space-y-6 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#4d4d4d] leading-relaxed">
      <div class="bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#171717]">1. Non-Affiliation with YouTube & Google LLC</h2>
        <p>
          YouTube Video Downloader is an independent web application and technical utility. YouTube Video Downloader is <strong>not affiliated, associated, authorized, endorsed by, or in any way officially connected with YouTube, Google LLC, Alphabet Inc., or any of their subsidiaries or affiliates</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          The official YouTube website is accessible at <a href="https://www.youtube.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#0070f3] hover:underline font-medium">www.youtube.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#171717]">2. Trademark Attribution</h2>
        <p>
          The name "YouTube", as well as related names, marks, emblems, and images, are registered trademarks of Google LLC. Any use of the word "YouTube" on this website is made purely for descriptive and nominative identification purposes under fair use principles, in order to identify the external service whose publicly accessible content users may choose to process.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#171717]">3. No Content Hosting or Indexing</h2>
        <p>
          YouTube Video Downloader does not host, store, index, archive, or duplicate copyrighted media on its servers. The application functions solely as a client-initiated technical transmission pipeline, transferring stream chunks directly between the Content Delivery Network and the user's browser.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#171717]">4. User Responsibility for Copyright & Terms</h2>
        <p>
          YouTube's Terms of Service generally restrict downloading audiovisual content unless an authorized download link is expressly provided by YouTube or written permission is granted by the copyright owner.
        </p>
        <p>
          YouTube Video Downloader is intended strictly for downloading content that users personally own, videos published under permissive open licenses (such as Creative Commons CC-BY), public domain material, and for legitimate fair use or educational research purposes. Users bear the sole and exclusive legal responsibility for ensuring their usage conforms to applicable copyright laws and contractual obligations.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#171717]">5. Copyright Complaints & DMCA Inquiries</h2>
        <p>
          YouTube Video Downloader respects the intellectual property rights of all copyright creators. Because YouTube Video Downloader does not host or store any media files, removing content from the YouTube platform itself automatically prevents the tool from accessing it.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you have legal or copyright concerns regarding our service, please contact us at:
          <a href="mailto:dmca@youtubevideodownloader.app" class="text-[#0070f3] hover:underline font-medium ml-1">dmca@youtubevideodownloader.app</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

